CM_ SG_ 389 COUNTER "CONFIRMED: rolling 0-15, one step per frame.";
CM_ SG_ 656 CHECKSUM "CONFIRMED: AUTOSAR E2E Profile 2, as opendbc volkswagen_mqb_meb_checksum: crc=0xFF; for bytes 1..end: crc=CRC8H2F[crc^b]; crc^=K[counter]; crc=CRC8H2F[crc]; checksum=crc^0xFF. K is a 16-entry table per message in checksum_constants.json, learned on route 0000022d and exact on every tested frame of 3 other routes from 2 other days.";
